{"title":"Baby Imp","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 1 Imp that attacks with burn (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 5 times (2.1% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/baby-imp\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/baby-imp?lv=0\">Lv 0 <span>206</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/baby-imp?lv=1\">Lv 1 <span>833</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/baby-imp\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>0</b></td><td>12</td><td>1</td><td>50</td><td class=\"muted\">36 · 1.4 · 150</td><td>206</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia\">Binxonia</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/baby-imp?lv=1\" title=\"Pick level 1\"><td><b>1</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>12</td><td>1</td><td>50</td><td class=\"muted\">36 · 1.4 · 150</td><td>833</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Smoldering%20Den\">Smoldering Den</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"baby-imp\" data-map-level=\"0\">Show level 0 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 14 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"imp-knick\" title=\"Imp Knick - in 13 of 14 looted corpses, 13 recorded drops, 13 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/3e91a24c9ffca006e992.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Imp Knick</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-small\" title=\"Stamina Potion Small - in 1 of 14 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7e73cfe258f353082838.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Small</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/14<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Imp Tree</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 28</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-1000006036\">Layout</button></li><li><b>Binxonia - Church</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 22</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-8\">Layout</button></li><li><b>Binxonia - Weapon Store</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 20</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-7\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-52.0px,37.9px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/-1/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-